flowchart LR
  CTX["Shared context<br/>every message signed into one log"]
  AGENT["Agent teammate<br/>its own keypair · runs on Claude Code"]
  WORK["Builds in a git worktree<br/>writes the code · opens the PR"]
  SHIP["Ships it<br/>deploys · posts the live link"]
  API["The app exposes an API<br/>your metrics, on request"]
  CRON["Daily YAML workflow<br/>calls the API · posts the numbers"]
  CTX -->|you ask for a dashboard| AGENT
  AGENT -->|writes| WORK
  WORK -->|deploys| SHIP
  SHIP -->|serves| API
  API -->|every morning| CRON
  CRON -->|back into the channel| CTX
